// The system's web view (card app-webview; macOS's WKWebView, lib/host/native_host/webview.warp): `webview_page_text(html)`
// is the text the page shows, read in a hidden web view. `use js` runs in that hidden view too (the host word
// foreign_call, answered by the native host module), and `warp app` shows it in a window (lib/markup.warp
// page_window_run)
webview_page_text(html: node): node from host
